# The kick, its key held (black 6): K1-K3 DROP, DECAY, CLICK (PULSE's), K4 TUNE in the key (the root, the
# fourth, the fifth, the octave); ALGO it by itself (a heartbeat, every bar, every half bar, every 2 bars),
# on the clock. SHAPE's PULSE 2: TUNE, DRIVE, DUCK, BY ITSELF. SCENE's LANDS: a kick as each new key comes in.
# MIDI on the next channel plays it as hard as it is played. Audio in kick.wav (DUCK: the drone dipping)
autoplay 0
wait 300
wav kick.wav
key b5 down
turn K4 2
expect kick_tune 2
turn K2 -5
expect shape32 70
turn ALGO 2
expect kick_auto 2
shot kick_hold.png
key b5 up
expect view 0
# by itself: every bar, on the clock (90 BPM: a bar 2.67 s)
expect kicks 1
tap SEQ
wait 5500
expect kicks >2
expect kicks <5
# PULSE 2 (ENV after the hold: its page)
tap ENV
expect page 7
turn K3 40
expect kick_duck 80
turn K2 10
expect kick_drive 40
shot pulse2.png
wait 3000
# by hand again (PULSE 2's BY ITSELF), and the scene's LANDS
turn K4 -4
expect kick_auto 0
tap EDIT
turn SELECT 15
turn K2 1
expect kick_land 1
shot lands.png
tap HOME
wait 500
expect kicks_since >-1
turn PRESET 1
wait 13000
expect scene 2
expect kicks_since 1
wavstop
# MIDI: the kick on the next channel (note 41), as hard as it came
midi 91 29 30
wait 50
midi 81 29 00
wait 100
